{% comment %}
  Renders the tax note beneath a price.

  Trade customers think and buy in GST-exclusive terms; consumers expect to know
  GST is added. This makes the note accurate for each audience.

  Note: this changes the LABEL only, not the price. Whether retail prices should
  render GST-inclusive is a tax-presentation decision with NZ consumer-law
  implications — see the spec's open questions.

  Usage:
  {% render 'price-tax-note' %}
{% endcomment %}

<span class="price__tax caption">
  {%- if customer.b2b? -%}
    GST Excl.
  {%- else -%}
    GST Excl. — GST added at checkout
  {%- endif -%}
</span>
